        "emotion",
        "mental"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "The wolverine enters a state of pure rage that lasts either for 1 minute, until there are no enemies it can perceive, or until it falls unconscious, whichever comes first. While raging, the wolverine has AC 17, its jaws Strike deals 1d8+7 damage, and its claw Strike deals 1d6+7 damage. While raging, the wolverine can't use actions that have the concentrate trait, except for Seek. After it's stopped raging, a wolverine can't use Wolverine Rage again for 1 minute."
      ],
